mctrace 1
profile 1
precision f32
tick 1 time 41800000 dt 00000000
port gpio digital-read d 1
port gpio digital-write 2 1
port gpio set-pull d 0
port gpio servo-write 1 5a
port gpio digital-write 63 1
tick 2 time 42000000 dt 41800000
port gpio digital-read d 1
port gpio digital-write 2 1
port gpio set-pull d 0
port gpio servo-write 1 5a
port gpio digital-write 63 1
